---
// RoadmapKPI.astro - Strategic Roadmap & KPI Metrics: No Cards, No Gray Card Borders, No Border Radius
---

<section id="roadmap" class="py-24 md:py-32 bg-white relative border-b border-slate-200">
  <div class="max-w-[1586px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-9">
    <!-- Header -->
    <div class="max-w-3xl mb-16 md:mb-20" data-aos="fade-up">
      <span class="category">Rencana Strategis</span>
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-extrabold text-[#0f172a] tracking-tight mb-4">
        Roadmap Proyek & Standar Keandalan KPI.
      </h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-[#64748b] leading-relaxed">
        Pengembangan platform cloud storage Yonopod dipandu oleh linimasa yang terstruktur, mulai dari peluncuran MVP hingga ekspansi ekosistem enterprise.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- 4 Phases Timeline Grid (NO CARDS, NO GRAY CARD BORDERS, NO RADIUS) -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-8 mb-24">
      <!-- Phase 1 -->
      <div class="border-t-4 border-[#2563eb] pt-6 flex flex-col justify-between interactive-tilt p-5 bg-slate-50/50 hover:bg-white transition-all" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="50">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-2 text-xs font-mono font-bold">
            <span class="text-[#2563eb]">FASE 01 &bull; MVP</span>
            <span class="text-slate-500">Agus - Sep 2026</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#0f172a] mb-3">Core System & Soft Launch</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-[#64748b] leading-relaxed mb-6">
            Fondasi platform web drive, pengujian komprehensif, dan peluncuran resmi sistem siap pakai.
          </p>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-xs text-slate-800 font-sans">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span class="text-[#2563eb] font-bold">&bull;</span>
              <span>File & Folder Explorer responsif</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span class="text-[#2563eb] font-bold">&bull;</span>
              <span>Integrasi awal Huby Object Storage</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span class="text-[#2563eb] font-bold">&bull;</span>
              <span>Fitur Audit Log & Folder Analyzer</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span class="text-[#2563eb] font-bold">&bull;</span>
              <span>Deployment Main & Worker Server</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-8 pt-3 border-t border-slate-200 text-xs font-mono text-emerald-700 font-bold">
          STATUS: TAHAP PENGEMBANGAN
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Phase 2 -->
      <div class="border-t-4 border-[#06b6d4] pt-6 flex flex-col justify-between interactive-tilt p-5 bg-slate-50/50 hover:bg-white transition-all" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="100">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-2 text-xs font-mono font-bold">
            <span class="text-[#06b6d4]">FASE 02 &bull; MONETISASI</span>
            <span class="text-slate-500">Okt - Des 2026</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#0f172a] mb-3">Stabilisasi & Target 5 TB</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-[#64748b] leading-relaxed mb-6">
            Validasi pasar, aktivasi gateway saldo pulsa, dan pencapaian titik impas operasional.
          </p>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-xs text-slate-800 font-sans">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span class="text-[#06b6d4] font-bold">&bull;</span>
              <span>Aktivasi Gateway Top-Up Saldo (QRIS)</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span class="text-[#06b6d4] font-bold">&bull;</span>
              <span>Pencapaian 100 Pengguna Aktif Berbayar</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span class="text-[#06b6d4] font-bold">&bull;</span>
              <span>Total Kapasitas Tersimpan 5 Terabyte</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span class="text-[#06b6d4] font-bold">&bull;</span>
              <span>Break-Even Operasional Tahap Awal</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-8 pt-3 border-t border-slate-200 text-xs font-mono text-[#06b6d4] font-bold">
          TARGET: Q4 2026
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Phase 3 -->
      <div class="border-t-4 border-indigo-600 pt-6 flex flex-col justify-between interactive-tilt p-5 bg-slate-50/50 hover:bg-white transition-all" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="150">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-2 text-xs font-mono font-bold">
            <span class="text-indigo-600">FASE 03 &bull; EKSPANSI</span>
            <span class="text-slate-500">Jan - Jun 2027</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#0f172a] mb-3">Embed File & Video HLS</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-[#64748b] leading-relaxed mb-6">
            Pengembangan fitur unggulan untuk web embed dan streaming media berkualitas tinggi.
          </p>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-xs text-slate-800 font-sans">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span class="text-indigo-600 font-bold">&bull;</span>
              <span>Peluncuran fitur Yonopod Embed (Bebas CORB)</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span class="text-indigo-600 font-bold">&bull;</span>
              <span>Player Video Streaming Adaptif HLS</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span class="text-indigo-600 font-bold">&bull;</span>
              <span>API Pengembang & Integrasi Webhook</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span class="text-indigo-600 font-bold">&bull;</span>
              <span>Kemitraan Komunitas Kampus & Developer</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-8 pt-3 border-t border-slate-200 text-xs font-mono text-slate-500 font-bold">
          TARGET: SEMESTER 1 2027
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Phase 4 -->
      <div class="border-t-4 border-[#0f172a] pt-6 flex flex-col justify-between interactive-tilt p-5 bg-slate-50/50 hover:bg-white transition-all" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="200">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-2 text-xs font-mono font-bold">
            <span class="text-[#0f172a]">FASE 04 &bull; SCALE</span>
            <span class="text-slate-500">Jul 2027+</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#0f172a] mb-3">Multi-Region & B2B</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-[#64748b] leading-relaxed mb-6">
            Penskalaan infrastruktur cloud masif, multi-region redundancy, dan layanan enterprise terintegrasi.
          </p>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-xs text-slate-800 font-sans">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span class="text-slate-900 font-bold">&bull;</span>
              <span>Multi-Region Worker Server Cluster</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span class="text-slate-900 font-bold">&bull;</span>
              <span>Aggressive Edge Caching (Cloudflare)</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span class="text-slate-900 font-bold">&bull;</span>
              <span>Paket Tim dengan RBAC granular</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-8 pt-3 border-t border-slate-200 text-xs font-mono text-slate-500 font-bold">
          TARGET: JANGKA PANJANG
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 6 KPI Metrics in Flat Technical Matrix (NO CARDS, NO GRAY CARD BORDERS, NO RADIUS) -->
    <div class="pt-12 border-t-2 border-[#0f172a]" data-aos="fade-up">
      <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-end justify-between mb-10">
        <div>
          <span class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-[#06b6d4] uppercase tracking-widest">METRIK KINERJA PRODUKSI</span>
          <h3 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-[#0f172a] mt-1">
            Standar Kualitas & Key Performance Indicator (KPI)
          </h3>
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs font-mono text-slate-500 mt-2 md:mt-0">
          Uji Beban & Keandalan Terverifikasi
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-6 gap-6 font-mono">
        <!-- KPI 1 -->
        <div class="p-4 bg-slate-100 border-l-2 border-[#06b6d4] interactive-tilt" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="50">
          <div class="text-3xl font-black text-[#06b6d4] mb-1">
            &gt; <span data-counter data-target="99" data-suffix="%">99%</span>
          </div>
          <div class="text-xs font-bold text-[#0f172a] uppercase">Upload Success</div>
          <div class="text-[10px] text-slate-500 mt-1 font-sans">Rasio unggah tanpa gagal</div>
        </div>

        <!-- KPI 2 -->
        <div class="p-4 bg-slate-100 border-l-2 border-[#2563eb] interactive-tilt" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="100">
          <div class="text-3xl font-black text-[#2563eb] mb-1">
            &lt; <span data-counter data-target="500" data-suffix="ms">500ms</span>
          </div>
          <div class="text-xs font-bold text-[#0f172a] uppercase">API Response</div>
          <div class="text-[10px] text-slate-500 mt-1 font-sans">Waktu respons server</div>
        </div>

        <!-- KPI 3 -->
        <div class="p-4 bg-slate-100 border-l-2 border-[#06b6d4] interactive-tilt" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="150">
          <div class="text-3xl font-black text-[#06b6d4] mb-1">
            &lt; <span data-counter data-target="100" data-suffix="ms">100ms</span>
          </div>
          <div class="text-xs font-bold text-[#0f172a] uppercase">Resolve File</div>
          <div class="text-[10px] text-slate-500 mt-1 font-sans">Kecepatan file ber-cache</div>
        </div>

        <!-- KPI 4 -->
        <div class="p-4 bg-slate-100 border-l-2 border-[#2563eb] interactive-tilt" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="200">
          <div class="text-3xl font-black text-[#2563eb] mb-1">
            &lt; <span data-counter data-target="2" data-suffix="s">2s</span>
          </div>
          <div class="text-xs font-bold text-[#0f172a] uppercase">Pencarian Data</div>
          <div class="text-[10px] text-slate-500 mt-1 font-sans">Hasil akurat instan</div>
        </div>

        <!-- KPI 5 -->
        <div class="p-4 bg-slate-100 border-l-2 border-emerald-600 interactive-tilt" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="250">
          <div class="text-3xl font-black text-emerald-600 mb-1">
            <span data-counter data-target="99.9" data-suffix="%">99.9%</span>
          </div>
          <div class="text-xs font-bold text-[#0f172a] uppercase">Server Uptime</div>
          <div class="text-[10px] text-slate-500 mt-1 font-sans">Keandalan aktif bulanan</div>
        </div>

        <!-- KPI 6 -->
        <div class="p-4 bg-slate-100 border-l-2 border-[#0f172a] interactive-tilt" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="300">
          <div class="text-3xl font-black text-[#0f172a] mb-1">
            &gt; <span data-counter data-target="50" data-suffix="%">50%</span>
          </div>
          <div class="text-xs font-bold text-[#0f172a] uppercase">Reduksi Duplikat</div>
          <div class="text-[10px] text-slate-500 mt-1 font-sans">Pembersihan ruang sampah</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
